   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I knew the answers.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "My hands just stopped.",
   "nefes": 0.6,
   "mark": "hands",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I walked out and never went back.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I told nobody.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "That night I played Demolition Master until morning.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": "game",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "It did not teach me engineering.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "A game can't do that.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "It just reminded me that I like working out where to start.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Defne did not shout.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "She said, \"Okay.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici",
   "alinti": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then stop lying to Daisy too.\"",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "And she moved her desk into the yard.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "With her signature, the city gave us our permit back.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Three, four, five.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": "permit",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Three more old buildings came down, slow and safe.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she opened Grandpa's reports on number nine.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "She read for an hour.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she went pale.",
